You can run any vanilla script without an API key. The AI scripts will print a message and run in offline mode if no key is set.
Concatenating DNA Fragments# In the lab, scientists join DNA fragments using restriction enzymes and ligase. In Python, we use the + operator. This script concatenates two fragments and examines the result.
